{"code":"ru-RU","name":"Russian","native":"Русский","badge":"RU","tts":"ru-RU","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Я не понимаю.","say":"ya nee pa-nee-MA-yu","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Я не знаю.","say":"ya nee ZNA-yu","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Минутку, пожалуйста.","say":"mee-NOOT-koo, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Повторите, пожалуйста.","say":"paf-ta-REE-tye, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"Please say that again.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Помедленнее, пожалуйста.","say":"pa-MYED-lyen-nee-ye, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Как сказать «…» по-русски?","say":"kak ska-ZAT … pa-ROOS-kee","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Конечно.","say":"ka-NYESH-na","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Точно.","say":"TOCH-na","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Думаю, да.","say":"DOO-ma-yu, DA","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Правда?","say":"PRAV-da","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Без проблем.","say":"byez pra-BLYEM","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Отлично!","say":"at-LEECH-na","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Где {x}?","say":"gdye {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Я хочу {x:acc}.","say":"ya kha-CHOO {x:acc}","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"У вас есть {x}?","say":"oo vas YEST {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, пожалуйста.","say":"{x:acc}, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Мне нужно {x}.","say":"mnye NOOZH-na {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Можно {x}?","say":"MOZH-na {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Я проверю.","say":"ya pra-VYE-ryu","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"У меня встреча.","say":"oo mee-NYA FSTRYE-cha","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Это острое?","say":"E-ta OS-tra-ye","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Без лука, пожалуйста.","say":"byez LOO-ka, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Что вы посоветуете?","say":"shto vy pa-sa-VYE-too-ye-tye","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Я не ем мясо.","say":"ya nee YEM MYA-sa","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Сколько стоит?","say":"SKOL-ka STO-eet","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Я просто смотрю.","say":"ya PROS-ta smat-RYU","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Я возьму это.","say":"ya vaz-MOO E-ta","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Можно картой?","say":"MOZH-na KAR-tai","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Это далеко?","say":"E-ta da-lee-KO","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"В аэропорт, пожалуйста.","say":"v a-e-ra-PORT, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"налево · направо · прямо","say":"na-LYE-va · na-PRA-va · PRYA-ma","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Помогите!","say":"pa-ma-GEE-tye","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Нет туалетной бумаги.","say":"nyet too-a-LYET-nai boo-MA-gee","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Мне плохо.","say":"mnye PLO-kha","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Вызовите скорую, пожалуйста.","say":"VY-za-vee-tye SKO-roo-yu, pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Очень приятно.","say":"O-chen pree-YAT-na","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Откуда вы?","say":"at-KOO-da vy","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Кем вы работаете?","say":"kyem vy ra-BO-ta-ye-tye","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Очень вкусно!","say":"O-chen FKOOS-na","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Здравствуйте.","say":"ZDRAST-vooy-tye","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Доброе утро.","say":"DOB-ra-ye OO-tra","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Как дела?","say":"kak dee-LA","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Да. · Нет.","say":"da · nyet","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Пожалуйста.","say":"pa-ZHAL-sta","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Спасибо.","say":"spa-SEE-ba","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Извините.","say":"eez-vee-NEE-tye","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"До свидания.","say":"da svee-DA-nee-ya","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"один · два · три","say":"a-DEEN · dva · tree","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"четыре · пять · шесть","say":"chee-TY-rye · pyat · shest","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"семь · восемь · девять","say":"syem · VO-syem · DYE-vyat","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"десять · двадцать · сто","say":"DYE-syat · DVA-tsat · sto","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Яблоко красное.","say":"YAB-la-ka KRAS-na-ye","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” and no “a / the”"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Я ем яблоко.","say":"ya yem YAB-la-ka","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"endings, not word order, show who does what"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Я съел яблоко.","say":"ya syel YAB-la-ka","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past ends in -л (a woman says съела)"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Я хочу съесть яблоко.","say":"ya kha-CHOO syest YAB-la-ka","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Ты ешь яблоки?","say":"ty yesh YAB-la-kee","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"same words, the voice rises on the key word"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"туалет","say":"too-a-LYET","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"аптека","say":"ap-TYE-ka","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"больница","say":"bal-NEE-tsa","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"вокзал","say":"vak-ZAL","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"аэропорт","say":"a-e-ra-PORT","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"гостиница","say":"ga-STEE-nee-tsa","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"вода","say":"va-DA","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink","acc":"воду","accSay":"VO-doo"},{"id":"coffee","t":"кофе","say":"KO-fye","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"счёт","say":"shchyot","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"меню","say":"mee-NYU","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"пиво","say":"PEE-va","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"это","say":"E-ta","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"пакет","say":"pa-KYET","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"встреча","say":"FSTRYE-cha","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom","acc":"встречу","accSay":"FSTRYE-choo"},{"id":"file","t":"файл","say":"fail","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"экран","say":"ek-RAN","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"сообщение","say":"sa-ap-SHCHE-nee-ye","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"завтра","say":"ZAF-tra","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"уйти","say":"oo-ee-TEE","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"войти","say":"vai-TEE","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"заплатить","say":"za-pla-TEET","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Аллергия · пожалуйста, прочитайте","ask":"В этом блюде есть что-то из этого?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Большое спасибо!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"У меня сильная аллергия на арахис. Мне нельзя арахис и арахисовое масло.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"У меня сильная аллергия на морепродукты (креветки, крабы, моллюски).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Мне нельзя глютен (пшеница, ячмень, рожь).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Я не ем мясо, курицу и рыбу.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Я не ем свинину.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"ТУАЛЕТ","en":"Restroom"},{"t":"М · Ж","en":"М = men (мужчины), Ж = women (женщины)","warn":true},{"t":"ВЫХОД · ВХОД","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ОТ СЕБЯ · К СЕБЕ","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"ЗАПАСНЫЙ ВЫХОД","en":"Emergency exit"}]}